\newlabel{tab:current_original_space}{{S9}{13}{\textbf {Original-space topological metrics for the 927-frame ensemble.} Silhouette labels correspond to the 15 model identities visualized in the main text. Standardization applies column-wise z-scoring across the aggregate diagnostic sample to normalize explicit feature scales. The invariant neighbor-distance bins isolate structural separation independently of the trajectory-specific PCA bases. Scores quantify topological clustering within the explicitly sampled population horizons}{table.9}{}}
