\newlabel{fig:endpoint_campaign_overview}{{S6}{18}{\textbf {Relaxation outcomes across the 846-task campaign.} (A) Final-force distributions by system and perturbation arm. (B) Maximum-displacement distributions by system and arm. (C) FIRE-step distributions by system and arm. (D) Initial maximum force versus final maximum displacement for individual endpoints. Each system--arm group contains 47 endpoints; points and distributions retain endpoint-level variation}{figure.6}{}}
